    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d424">

                <pb facs="0670" n="650" sameAs="frus:frus1864p2/pg650"/>

                <head>Lord Lyons to Mr. Seward.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1864-07-12"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >July</hi> 12, 1864.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir:</hi> With reference to your note of the 24th May
                    last, and to my answer of the 6th ultimo, concerning resolutions passed by the
                    Chamber of Commerce of New York, with respect to the affair of the Chesapeake, I
                    am directed by her Majesty’s principal secretary of state for foreign affairs to
                    inform you that he has caused a copy of those resolutions to be transmitted to
                    the Colonial Department, with a request that the resolution in acknowledgment of
                    the proceedings of the magistrate who had charge of the Chesapeake may be
                    communicated to him. Her Majesty’s secretary of state has moreover caused to be
                    transmitted to Sir Samuel Cunard a copy of the resolution on the subject of the
                    assistance rendered by Messrs. Cunard &amp; Co.’s agency at Halifax to the
                    United States ship Ella and Annie.</p>
                <p>I have the honor to be, with the highest consideration, sir, your most obedient,
                    humble servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>LYONS.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">William H. Seward,</hi><hi
                            rendition="#italic">&amp;c., &amp;c., &amp;c.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
